Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:23.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}French Open finalist, Wimbledon finalist, US Open champion — and now your 2026 Junior Finals champion!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N法网亚军 温网亚军 美网冠军\N现在是成都总决赛的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.53,0:00:29.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Sun shines in Chengdu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阳光 照耀成都
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:39.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun Xinran: 40 and 3 on this 2026 season at the junior level.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个赛季 她四十胜三负
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:42.02,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}场球 她只丢了一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.58,0:00:45.56,TL,,0,0,0,,首战 她一度{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:47.56,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:49.69,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然叫了医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.69,0:00:53.33,TL,,0,0,0,,右膝缠上绷带 她重新站回底线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.13,0:01:04.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The player is staying fairly central there — the tape from behind the baseline,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N球员站位保持居中\N球擦网带而过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:09.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it is match point for Xinran Sun.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是孙心然的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:19.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's got two of them, and executes on the first.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两个赛点 第一个就兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:22.56,TL,,0,0,0,,第二场 只用了{\fs78}50{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:24.74,TL,,0,0,0,,再遇普什卡列娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.74,0:01:27.08,TL,,0,0,0,,温网决赛赢她的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:30.11,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 孙心然没有给她机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:33.69,TL,,0,0,0,,第一个赛点 她直接拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.69,0:01:36.51,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}50{\fs68}分钟 小组赛两连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:41.94,TL,,0,0,0,,末轮 她打得最从容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:44.88,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘她一度{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:48.71,TL,,0,0,0,,连扳{\fs78}3{\fs68}局 破发之后{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.73,0:01:54.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Match point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.73,0:02:07.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This crowd in Chengdu got exactly what they came to see{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N成都观众\N等到了想看的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:09.70,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 她更快了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.93,0:02:13.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's just been so sound.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的发挥太稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.83,0:02:18.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Too many of those forehands sailing along.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对手的正手频频出界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:26.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun continues to test that wing — and now she's got two match points.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她继续压制那一侧\N拿到了两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:53.11,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 又是普什卡列娃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.78,0:02:54.88,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:58.65,TL,,0,0,0,,她在对方的发球局动手 破发 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:04.49,TL,,0,0,0,,发球胜盘局 她没有手软
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:06.99,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 第一盘拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.33,0:03:22.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And so it's a set point fought off, a bullet dodged.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N盘点救回来了\N躲过一劫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:30.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wow — Sun Xinran has yet to drop a set this tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周 她还没有丢过一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:41.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First tiebreak in the five career head-to-head matchups between these two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N五次交手里的第一个抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:51.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Could tell that was the do-or-die point for Sun Xinran.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看得出 这是她的生死分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:53.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just full acceleration.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她全速出击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.23,0:04:02.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Does it provide a spark to turn around this tiebreak?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这会是翻盘的火花吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:18.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Drop shot successful — four set points to send us to a decider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N吊小球得手\N四个盘点 决胜盘在招手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:28.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, misses it wide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍 打出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.23,0:04:31.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A deciding set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛进入决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:52.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}French Open finalist, Wimbledon finalist, US Open champion — and now your 2026 Junior Finals champion!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N法网亚军 温网亚军 美网冠军\N现在是成都总决赛的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.53,0:04:58.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Sun shines in Chengdu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阳光 照耀成都
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.93,0:05:08.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun Xinran: 40 and 3 on this 2026 season at the junior level.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个赛季 她四十胜三负
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.73,0:05:17.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Eight events, seven finals, and another crown to her name.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N八站比赛 七进决赛 又一冠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.23,0:05:29.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I played the whole match according to my game plan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N整场比赛按照战术来执行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:36.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Anna played really well today, too.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安娜打得也非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:44.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I just kept telling myself: don't give up, hang in there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我就想着不要放弃 坚持下来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.23,0:05:51.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Play my best tennis no matter what. I believed I could do it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N无论怎样打出自己最好的网球\N我相信我一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.13,0:05:55.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I also want to say something to Anna.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我也想对安娜说几句
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.33,0:06:00.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We play each other four times this year. I cannot believe it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今年我们交手了四次 不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:06.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I hope I don't see you next year — but you're an amazing player.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N希望明年别再碰到你 你太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.03,0:06:10.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I like to play with you, and we are really good friends.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我喜欢和你打球 我们是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:13.45,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 不要放弃坚持下来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:15.54,TL,,0,0,0,,我相信我一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:19.08,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁 五战全胜 年终世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:21.43,TL,,0,0,0,,下一站广州 成人赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:23.83,TL,,0,0,0,,她能把这股劲带到哪儿？
